Package: ubutils
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: UB device query and configuration utilities
 ubutils ships the lsub and setub command line tools used to inspect
 UB device topology and to query or configure UB protocol settings
 through sysfs.
 .
 The package also includes the ub.ids hardware database and manual
 pages for the installed commands.
